\ Run init — first emitting token, so it lands right after the prologue
\ and runs before any user code. Every program is set up automatically.

\ ============================================================
\ Arithmetic, comparison, bitwise.  ( a b -- ) with b on top.
\ Comparisons yield a Forth flag: -1 = true (all bits), 0 = false.
\ No RISC-V M extension, so * / % are shift/subtract loops (: words).
\ ============================================================

